INSERT INTO blog_post_translations
  (post_id, locale, slug, title, excerpt, body_html, seo_title, seo_description)
VALUES (
  :post_id, 'en', $x$gaming-subscriptions-uzbekistan$x$,
  $x$Gaming subscriptions in Uzbekistan: what you can get$x$,
  $x$Discord Nitro, Telegram Premium and Telegram Stars: what each one gives, who it suits and how to pay in soʻm with Click, Payme or Uzum.$x$,
$x$<h2>Key takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>In Uzbekistan you can get Discord Nitro and Telegram Premium paid in soʻm, and buy Telegram Stars.</li>
<li>Nitro is for people who live in Discord voice channels and stream to friends. Premium is for people who live in Telegram.</li>
<li>Stars are not a subscription but Telegram's currency for one-off purchases.</li>
<li>Game Pass and PS Plus are a different kind of subscription, for consoles. Their stores have no Uzbek region, so you cannot pay for them in soʻm directly.</li>
</ul>
<p>The easiest subscriptions for a gamer in Uzbekistan are the ones not tied to a console or a store region: Discord Nitro and Telegram Premium. Below: what each one gives, who needs it and how to pay.</p>
<h2>What you can get</h2>
<p><strong>Discord Nitro.</strong> 1 GB uploads, high-quality streaming, two server boosts, an animated avatar and your own emoji on any server. There is a lighter Nitro Basic: 50 MB uploads, no boosts. Nitro is $9.99 a month, Basic $2.99 (<a href="https://discord.com/nitro">Discord</a>). Tiers in detail: <a href="/en/blog/discord-nitro-uzbekistan">Discord Nitro in Uzbekistan</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Telegram Premium.</strong> 4 GB uploads, faster downloads, more channels and folders, voice-to-text, an emoji status and premium stickers. One subscription covers all your devices. More in <a href="/en/blog/telegram-premium">Telegram Premium in Uzbekistan</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Telegram Stars.</strong> Telegram's currency. You spend them in bots and mini apps, on gifts and on supporting channels. It is a one-off purchase: you spend what you bought.</p>
<h2>Game Pass and PS Plus</h2>
<p>Game Pass and PS Plus are game-library and online subscriptions for Xbox and PlayStation. Comparing them with Nitro and Premium makes no sense: they do a different job.</p>
<p>Microsoft Store and PlayStation Store have no Uzbek region, so you cannot pay for these subscriptions in soʻm directly. If you own a console, that is a separate question, settled through another region's account and its rules.</p>
<h2>Which one to pick</h2>
<ul>
<li>You play on PC and spend time in Discord voice channels: take Nitro. If you need neither boosts nor big files, Nitro Basic is enough.</li>
<li>You chat in Telegram, run a channel or a clan chat: take Premium.</li>
<li>You do not want a subscription but need to pay a bot, send a gift or support a channel: buy Stars.</li>
</ul>
<p>If in doubt, start with one subscription for your main platform. You can add a second one later.</p>
<h2>How to pay in soʻm</h2>
<p>On YuPay every subscription is priced in soʻm. The total is shown before payment, and exactly that is charged. Pay with Click, Payme or Uzum; no foreign card needed.</p>
<ol>
<li>Open the page you need: <a href="/en/store/discord">Discord</a>, <a href="/en/store/telegram-premium">Telegram Premium</a> or <a href="/en/store/telegram-stars">Telegram Stars</a>.</li>
<li>Pick the term or the amount.</li>
<li>For Premium and Stars, enter your Telegram @username. No password or SMS code needed.</li>
<li>Pay.</li>
</ol>
<p>Premium and Stars arrive on the account by username. Nitro arrives as a code in the order and by email: you redeem it in Discord settings, under «Gift Inventory».</p>
<h2>What to watch for</h2>
<ul>
<li>Check the username before paying. The subscription goes to the account you entered.</li>
<li>If a Nitro code is a gift, do not open it yourself, or the subscription will attach to your profile.</li>
<li>Never share your password or SMS codes. A purchase does not need them. More in <a href="/en/blog/buy-in-game-currency-safely">how to buy in-game currency safely</a>.</li>
</ul>$x$,
  $x$Gaming subscriptions in Uzbekistan: Nitro, Premium, Stars$x$,
  $x$Discord Nitro, Telegram Premium and Telegram Stars in Uzbekistan: what each subscription gives, who it suits and how to pay in soʻm with Click, Payme or Uzum.$x$
);

